<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8374" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circum-vŏlo</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a. (not ante-Aug.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop., <i>to fly
			around</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turba (Harpyiae) praedam circumvolat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 3, 233</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">seu (me) mors atris circumvolat alis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 2, 1, 58</span></i>
			; so <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 2, 360</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caput,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 6, 866</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 2, 719</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 507</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sedem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint.
					2, 6, 7</span></i>
			: aliquem, * <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Aug. 97</span></i>.—<i>Pass.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nave circumvolatā ab halcyone,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					10, 32, 47, § 90</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			gen., <i>to run</i> or <i>hasten
			around</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ordines exercitus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vell.
					2, 27, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jaculo campum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					17, 416</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
